Hi Ingo,

You either need to have verbose=FALSE or make a second FITS list object that only has the selected models only from FITS. As it is, you have more than one fit object per telemetry object and akde() doesn't know what to do with that. I don't think this shouldn't have worked previously, if it did. I didn't code for that to work.

Best,
Chris

